From 5602b24f43db05b358306fcb56b2b8b54ab8aa4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phillip Blucas <pblucas@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:10:16 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] avcodec/hevc: decode tiles serially with constrained intra
 prediction

With constrained_intra_pred_flag set, intra sample substitution checks
whether neighbouring PUs are intra coded, for example the up-left one,
gated only on the block not being at the picture edge. At a tile edge
that PU belongs to another tile, which under tile-parallel slice
threading is being decoded by another thread at the same time, so the
read is a data race; TSan reports it on PPS_A_qualcomm_7.

Keep such pictures on the serial path.

Signed-off-by: Phillip Blucas <pblucas@gmail.com>

(cherry picked from commit 5602b24f43db05b358306fcb56b2b8b54ab8aa4a)
Upstream: https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/5602b24f43db05b358306fcb56b2b8b54ab8aa4a
---
 libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c b/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c
index 7cde07a..1ef217f 100644
--- a/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c
+++ b/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c
@@ -3246,6 +3246,7 @@ static int decode_slice_data(HEVCContext *s, const HEVCLayerContext *l,
         s->sh.num_entry_point_offsets > 0                &&
         pps->tiles_enabled_flag                          &&
         !pps->entropy_coding_sync_enabled_flag           &&
+        !pps->constrained_intra_pred_flag                &&
         s->sh.first_slice_in_pic_flag                    &&
         s->sh.num_entry_point_offsets + 1 == pps->num_tile_rows * pps->num_tile_columns)
         return hls_slice_data_tiles(s, nal);
